  "body": "ZYRAXON v6.24.3\n\nOne app for everything you do on a phone.\n\nBuild a website, edit a video, write and run code, put together a document,\nresearch any topic, or hand over an everyday task — by typing, by voice, or by\npointing at whatever is on the screen. It plans, it runs the tools, and it shows\nits work as it goes.\n\nThis release moves the assistant onto ZYRAXON's own cloud, end to end:\n\n- Every request goes to ZYRAXON and comes back through ZYRAXON. The app talks to\n  one address for conversations, live updates and the model list, so the whole\n  assistant is self-contained and fast to wake.\n- The website helper answers on its own, with no second backend.\n- A cleaner core: the cloud layer is named for what it is, preferences start\n  fresh, and the model list is presented as ZYRAXON's own.\n\nEverything you already rely on is here: phone tools, terminal and Linux, screen\nreading, voice, files, and a chat history you can pick up on any device.\n\n"
